    # p "I won't borrow too many."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2889
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_91eacbdb:

    # "Sam grins at you, and you make your retreat."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2902
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_e161d9d7:

    # "You do wonder what the two are discussing."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2906
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_88cba52b:

    # "She must, you figure, be planning on asking Rajeeyah about the city's bathhouses."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2908
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_b3fba097:

    # "It's a private conversation, after all. Perhaps venting frustrations about Perce."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2915
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_32c9a970:

    # "There are no sailors in the berths; anyone not working a shift, you suppose, is taking advantage of the time in port to sleep topside."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2919
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_e5ddb8e0:

    # "You find Sam's chest without too much difficulty. Inside are her clothes, some utensils, a deck of cards you spot, and a collection of small... jewelry?"
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2921
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_0fba9d7a:

    # "Totems, perhaps. A carved shell. A brass animal of some kind."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2923
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_28eef4f4:

    # "For a moment you think about having a closer look, but rummaging around feels too invasive. Something to ask her about, instead, when you get the chance."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2935
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_7085484c:

    # "You retrieve the coin purse and return topside."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2937
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_400add30:

    # "Sam and Rajeeyah are nowhere to be seen, although when you make your way to the infirmary you hear their voices."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2947
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_27fc134e:

    # "So, no great mystery about where they've gone to—probably desiring even more privacy."
